#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:3
#: c44f03ac4012406196a52d75129f37b0
msgid ""
"Run a robot demonstration with the default `hardware:=mock_components` "
"plugin (`mock_components/GenericSystem` on Acone xacro). No Gazebo / "
"Isaac / physical robot."
msgstr ""
"用默认的 `hardware:=mock_components` 插件运行演示（Acone xacro 上为 "
"`mock_components/GenericSystem`）。不需要 Gazebo / Isaac / 真机。"

