#: 02719a6c550947289fc020159de058de
msgid "Workspace initialized with `./init_repo.sh` and `colcon build`"
msgstr "已用 `./init_repo.sh` 初始化工作区并完成 `colcon build`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md:9
#: 21653895d7514f4d957794863053d47d
msgid ""
"Lean branches (`arx-lift2s`, `panthera-ht`): `./quick_start.sh` (it "
"sources `install/` after a successful build). On `open-deploy-ws` `main`,"
" after `colcon build`, `source install/setup.bash` in the launch terminal"
" (standard ROS overlay; no extra env script)."
msgstr ""
"精简分支（`arx-lift2s`、`panthera-ht`）：`./quick_start.sh`（构建成功后会 source `install/`）。在 `open-deploy-ws` 的 `main` 上，`colcon build` 之后在启动终端 `source install/setup.bash`（标准 ROS overlay；没有额外环境脚本）。"

